# The engine-consumed files of game projects (the .eproj, the root .luaurc and everything below Assets/) are stored and
# checked out byte for byte, so a fresh clone holds exactly the bytes the editor wrote and provenance hashed, whatever
# line endings a writer used (§13.12; ADR 0026 decision 13, G7). Scripts/AuditProvenance.py warns about CR LF text.
/Projects/*/Assets/** -text
/Projects/*/*.eproj -text
/Projects/*/.luaurc -text
/Tests/Projects/*/Assets/** -text
/Tests/Projects/*/*.eproj -text
/Tests/Projects/*/.luaurc -text
